            "detailed_description": "Beach Ball Valley is a relaxing, playful world, complete with pizza paddles. Roll around in a flock of beach balls, send 'em soaring over the hills, let them rain down on you, or pop them all! Everyone can enjoy VR in Beach Ball Valley - younger folk, older folk, or anyone who wants a vacation from dodging lasers and swinging swords.<br><br>There are three easy-to-understand minigames - with no way to lose, but a very high score cap if you want to challenge your friends. Or, mix things with zero gravity, becoming a giant, or piloting beach balls with your mind.<br><br>Beach Ball Valley is a great way to introduce people to VR. Tap keys on your keyboard to highlight buttons inside the game, start those minigames, or swarm friends with dozens of beach balls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;This is more fun than a room full of puppies&quot;</h2>Business Executive<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Weirdly fun&quot;</h2>Steam Reviewer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game gave me a squeaky trigger :(<br>Dont spawn too much beach balls kids.</h2>Serious Beach Baller<br><br><br>Note to serious beach ballers: we've really dialed in the weight, gravity, flight spin dynamics, controller haptics and mind-control interactions to ensure things feel great. These may be the most advanced beach balls ever simulated in VR.",
